{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed design scope",
      "text": "Brand design quote accepted by Nali, buyer, and Temba, designer based in Kenya.\nProject: visual identity for buyer's fictional candle shop, Embercoil Studio.\nFee: USD 480, paid in full before work began.\n\nAgreed deliverables:\n- One primary logo in SVG and PNG formats.\n- Three social media profile graphics.\n- One editable brand guidelines document.\n- One color palette with four named colors and hex codes.\n\nDelivery will be by shared folder. The buyer may request one round of corrections to the delivered materials. Any additional design work will be quoted separately."
    },
    {
      "title": "Handover note",
      "text": "From: Temba\nTo: Nali\nSubject: Embercoil Studio handover\n\nThe shared folder is ready for your review. It contains primary-logo.svg and primary-logo.png, plus profile-graphic-1.png and profile-graphic-2.png. The remaining profile graphic is still in progress and is not included in this handover.\n\nThe folder also contains brand-guidelines.docx and palette.pdf. The palette lists four named colors and their hex codes: Ash #413F3C, Flame #D45B32, Wax #F0E6D3, and Night #252B38.\n\nPlease open the files and send any corrections together so I can handle them in the agreed revision round."
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-delivery chat",
      "text": "Nali 10:12: Thanks, I received the folder and can see both logo files.\n\nTemba 10:16: Great. The third profile graphic is not ready yet; I'll send it when it is finished.\n\nNali 10:19: Please do. I can use the first two in the meantime.\n\nNali 10:22: I also saw the guidelines file, but I haven't opened it yet. I'll review it with the palette this afternoon.\n\nTemba 10:25: Sounds good. Send me your combined correction requests after you've reviewed the files.\n\nNali 10:27: Will do, thank you."
    }
  ],
